{
  "name": "dsh-shared-memory",
  "version": "1.5.0",
  "description": "全局共享记忆：所有会话共用一份可读可改的 MEMORY.md，双硬盘分区镜像 + 历史快照 + 跨进程写锁。人设可对话调整；要求/指正/教训/方法/请求/会话/方法库/文档九个分区；按命中频率与重复强调（铁律）在主文件与可检索归档间双向流动；关键词共现联想 + BM25 排序，质疑度驱动换方法与翻归档；上下文压缩后自动重读。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "dsh",
    "README.md",
    "AGENTS.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-bundle",
    "memory",
    "shared-memory",
    "persona",
    "backup",
    "mirror",
    "bm25",
    "retrieval",
    "archive",
    "tiering"
  ],
  "author": "1148462398-hub",
  "license": "MIT",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/1148462398-hub/dsh-shared-memory#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/1148462398-hub/dsh-shared-memory.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/1148462398-hub/dsh-shared-memory/issues"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "tag": "latest"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./dsh/cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    }
  }
}
